          <baseCommit>e5a8c02dbfc5a6fc35101c2f9a356367410f49d8</baseCommit>
          <output>Stage 1 (&quot;Create Poem&quot;) completed as specified. Execute created one new file: blocks/org/blockml/bml/workspace/playground/NextPoem222.bml (untracked, hence the empty git diff). Content matches the InstructionTask: FQN org.blockml.bml.workspace.playground.NextPoem222, baseType core:Documentation, a fresh 4-stanza German poem about a tree (Buche) and a mushroom (Pilz), with properties title/author/year where author=&quot;John Doe&quot; aligns with the transformation parameters {author:&quot;John Doe&quot;,language:&quot;German&quot;}. File structure follows the workspace playground conventions (header comment with FQN, bml namespace + playground namespace declarations). No ModelTransformation or _meta/transform/ files were modified by Execute — the running T00012 file is unchanged. Stage 2 (&quot;Translate Poem&quot; to Spanish) remains Pending and is out of scope for this stage. Note: could not run `npx blockml validate` because Bash is disabled in this Reflect step; validation of the new block was not performed here.</output>
