          <output>Stage 2 applied a single coherent semantic change to blocks/org/blockml/bml/workspace/playground/NextPoem222.bml: the poem was translated from German into Spanish. All three affected regions are mutually consistent — the &lt;is> descriptor now reads 'translated into Spanish, about a tree and a mushroom' (subject 'a tree and a mushroom' preserved), the &lt;documentation> body holds the full Spanish rendering of all four stanzas (structure, stanza count, and imagery — beech/haya, mushroom/hongo, moss, dew, canopy — preserved), and the &lt;title> property value changed from 'Die Buche und der Pilz' to 'El haya y el hongo'. The &lt;author> value ('John Doe'), &lt;name>, &lt;type>, and &lt;baseType> (core:Documentation) were correctly left untouched. No ModelTransformation / _meta/transform/ files were modified by Execute, and no other model files were touched. Change is scoped and matches the stage intent.</output>
